<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 10 bln peseta bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 10 bln peseta bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Central HispanoAmericano and Banco Santander de Negocios.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.2	 MATURITY    24.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.345   PAY DATE    24.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
